# Data: the raw Kaggle dump is public, oversized (one file >100 MB), and
# re-downloadable, so it stays out. Track only the small derived tables
# (public BGG data + our context labels) plus the ratings parquet.
data/*
!data/processed/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/games.parquet
!data/processed/games_annotated.parquet
!data/processed/ratings.parquet

